# Perfume-Chem V19/V20 Exact-Decimal Formula Artifact Successor v2

This package performs one bounded repair: it recomputes derived formula-dose exports from canonical formula parts using exact Decimal strings.

## What changed

- Nine successor current-build formula IDs and hashes were issued.
- 663 formula rows received exact 1 mL, 5 mL and 30 mL dose strings.
- Formula signatures and ratio-bound n-ary records were rebound to successor hashes.
- Anti-chassis dimensions were preserved separately with no aggregate score.
- The formula-artifact quick-verification sub-gate now passes.

## What did not change

- canonical formula parts;
- target identities and target hashes;
- art direction;
- Inventory V5 mappings;
- Missing-Chemical Impact decisions;
- interaction hypotheses;
- physical, sensory, analytical, safety, procurement, installation, publication or release authority.

## Current gate

`HOLD`: 63 stock-lineage rows, undeployed V20 hardening, and four missing exact-byte dependencies remain.

